Package: python3-lazy-importer
Architecture: all
Description: A context manager for portable, opt-in lazy imports
 A backwards-compatibility shim allowing libraries to get lazy import
 semantics similar to PEP 810 automatically in Python 3.11+ without
 needing to set your minimum version to 3.15. In Python 3.15+, this falls
 back to the standard lazy imports mechanism.
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${python3:Depends},
 python3,
